     "html": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"border: #000000; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; padding: 10px;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 100%; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 100%; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
