     },
     "html": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">HASSLE FREE</span> <span style=\"color: #7fbf4b;\">ON-BOARDING.</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">We want our wellness professionals to have a great experience with us, so we take a somewhat unique approach to on-boarding after you register an account.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Instead of going back and forth about agreements and forms, we will email you one document that gathers key information we need to verify your business. This process helps us streamline your account setup and gives us insights into how we can best help you.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">When you join our community of medical professionals, you can expect:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Wholesale pricing</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Free shipping</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">A dedicated sales rep who is ready to help you grow your practice</span></li>\n</ul>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
