     "html": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">SUPPORTING <span style=\"color: #7fbf4b;\">HEALTHY COMMUNITIES</span>.</h2>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Our parent company,</span> <a href=\"https://www.foodsciencecorp.com/\" rel=\"noopener\">FoodScience\u00ae Corporation</a>,<span style=\"color: #000000;\"> has a proud tradition of supporting non-profits that improve the wellbeing of people in our community.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Our <strong>Good Neighbor Program</strong> benefits organizations like Camp Hochelaga and the Vermont Youth Conservation Corps with hands-on volunteer service every year.&nbsp;</span></p>",
